<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-31T13:46:28.531Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:46:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked a shopping complex in Osun, killing three and injuring four, while separate gun attacks killed three and wounded four in Sokoto targeting an ADC governorship candidate and prompted condemnation by Tambuwal. ISWAP fighters were killed in clashes with Nigerian troops in Borno and Yobe, with 48 militants killed and one soldier dead, and a separate attack on the Binnari community resulted in at least 58 deaths. Three abducted Islamic clerics in Zamfara were rescued after weeks of captivity. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQb01OMlkwWWoxQkt6YWpqMHJOeFdSSk1iYU5UMzRTbTdPMWd0UGYtd0JGUkRLZW04emtOR3RjQXhHZk9rRUZ3V0RJSU5VZGVNMTJQdUFzS3EtWmVyQ01yb1RJR3pUaFBVeGNlOC1zRGdZenpaM2lUby1fSGNKZmVLc21BTkU1SHlxTU54My1nMm1UbHp1TGQ4X2QtZWI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Blueprint Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOZFpuSk5xNEVMa0JiWEJVNFI4WHJsLS1sOXZ3X01Ta2ZUX3ZybS13LUI3aGVIYXJtcXpoQlUzanFIZEt3SjhZVnFpb2pXN2hkaGhNR3NWXzZtdXFGS2p4YXFWWjVHV2FnaUIxVTgwcU56bjkwTUVRTjlMTzRjcEpwcE5NR2Q2WjVtRTNnU1hFald0RXRyR3ZGbGNaZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPZEdHSmlIbUh6THR6VVVHQ1BmSXlxYkswNzI2M285YnBDckhzcVFOVzdHU3BOZnY2S0ZBOHV0OTgzRWFMempYZF80NmtmUWViakRVVVlYOEtWQVFqcHE4eEZ0ZzVjTjRUQnR3VUlYTnRSMHl6bEpGbFJzaG4zTDVHaVI2TnZXUkhO?oc=5&quot;&gt;DAILY TIMES Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPMC1GNXpENGMxRjg1SXFCUDhhaFN2eXFFWXdLVzBSVkdTMGFmbUR3bDJWQUdsRlBHUkNTS2t0LTJMYVh2c0YyeDdGdmhDS0J2Ny1oTmJmcVk3bG16eFlUbVlZRUN0Rk1sU2ZRUWpjWERtcnk5TW5JTV9oeG1GcWJBdGVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;NigerianEye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUx